{
  "chapter": 0,
  "title": "Dreams and Dorms",
  "entries": [
    {
      "speaker": "Loudspeaker",
      "text": "It is now time for Hatsune Miku to head on stage!",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "assets/vn/backgrounds/ch0/0.jpg",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/0.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "I can't believe it…. I finally realised my dream! I'm a world famous idol!",
      "type": "thought",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/1.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "Okay, focus Miku, don't be stressed, breathe…",
      "type": "thought",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/2.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "This is your first concert, you can't mess it up.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/3.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "Ahem.. SEKA-",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/4.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": true
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Teto",
      "text": "SEKA-KA-KA-CAN YOU SHUT THE FUCK UP? I'm trying to SLEEP.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "assets/vn/backgrounds/ch0/1.jpg",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/5.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "Emm, sorr-",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/6.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": true
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Teto",
      "text": "You keep RUINING my sleep EVERY SINGLE FUCKING DAY OF THE WEEK.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/7.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "Listen I really didn't-",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/8.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": true
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Teto",
      "text": "You're not even sleep talking, you're fucking sleep SINGING. WHO THE HELLS ♪ Sings in their Fucking Sleep! ♪",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/9.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "Just let me-",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/10.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": true
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Teto",
      "text": "That's enough!!! This is the sixtyseventh time you're-",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/11.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": true
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "Six Seven!",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/12.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Teto",
      "text": "... ",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Teto",
      "text": "I'm reporting you to Marina Làoshí.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/13.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "Your tones are wrong.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/14.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Teto",
      "text": "AND YOU'RE TONE DEAF BECAUSE YOU CANT FUCKING SING!",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/15.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "Well… Hi, my name is Hatsune Miku…! This is my life, an ordinary student at BIT.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/16.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "As much as I would love to become a world famous singer, this is my life, just a regular college student.",
      "type": "thought",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/17.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "Well, it's now time to head to C Programming Practice class.",
      "type": "thought",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/18.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Cupcakke",
      "text": "Took you long enough",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "assets/vn/backgrounds/ch0/2.png",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/19.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "My fucking redhead roommate got woken up by my sleep singing again! And she even threatened to report me!",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/20.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Teto",
      "text": "I HEARD THAT.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/21.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "Oh…",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/22.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Cupcakke",
      "text": "She finna cook you.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/23.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "But forget it, we have class, hop on my Diandong and let's go!",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/24.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Cupcakke",
      "text": "Go go go go!",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/25.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Cupcakke",
      "text": "I heard the computer science teacher is a really weird guy",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "assets/vn/backgrounds/ch0/3.png",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/26.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "YEAAH, apparently back then he said some crazy shit like ‘90% of everything is trash’ and how he always yaps about random anecdotes that nobody gives a shit about, he's soooo weird and-",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/27.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Cupcakke",
      "text": "The dog.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/28.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "What?",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/29.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Cupcakke",
      "text": "THE. DOG.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/30.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "You know, no matter how much you dislike a certain person it is really disrespectful to call them a dog. You shouldn't be this impolite towards your teach-",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/31.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Cupcakke",
      "text": "WATCH THE ROAD THERE IS A FUCKING DOG",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/32.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "OH SHIT",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/33.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "NOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO!",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "assets/vn/backgrounds/ch0/4.png",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/35.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Cupcakke",
      "text": "I know right, poor dog, now he's injured.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/36.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "I dgaf about the dawg. I'm sad about my diandong.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/37.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Cupcakke",
      "text": "…",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/38.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "Yea, that shit cost me 5000 yuan, now it's damaged.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/39.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Cupcakke",
      "text": "We should do something about this dog though",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/40.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "No idgaf",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/41.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Cupcakke",
      "text": "Would you dgaf too if you were an Indonesian student crushed by a truck at 9:21 PM on the night of November 2nd while you were on the way to the Tianjie MRT station and nobody called an ambulance for you?",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/42.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "…. Girl, don't say that out loud… What if he's in the classroom right now.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/43.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Cupcakke",
      "text": "Oh, my bad.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/44.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "Oh look, it got up, let's chase after it!",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/45.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Cupcakke",
      "text": "What about C class?",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/46.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "Oh fuck that class, it's not like the teacher takes attendance anyways, just vibe code the entire project like every other group and you'll get an 80 or something don't fucking start complaining. You ain't getting no scholarship after that 40 in Calculus and how you were coping so bad about it, you convinced yourself that the teacher forgot your 20 points from the assignment so you harassed him on the WeChat group but actually you just fucking suck",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/47.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Cupcakke",
      "text": "It's not my fault I don't understand shit",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/48.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "Are you sure it went here?",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "assets/vn/backgrounds/ch0/6.png",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/49.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Cupcakke",
      "text": "Bitch do I look blind to you",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/50.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "But those stairs are kinda scary.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/51.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Cupcakke",
      "text": "Let's go deeper, I always wondered what was under those stairs.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/52.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "Watch out-",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/53.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": true
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Cupcakke",
      "text": "Ah!",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/54.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": true
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Lyoo",
      "text": "Welcome to the secret entrance of the Underground BIT-",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "assets/vn/backgrounds/ch0/5.png",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/80.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": true
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Cupcakke",
      "text": "Holy dog! A talking shit",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/81.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Lyoo",
      "text": "…",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "Ew it's a furry",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/82.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Lyoo",
      "text": "…",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/57.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Lyoo",
      "text": "WHAT DID YOU JUST CALL ME-",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/58.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Cupcakke",
      "text": "This place looks kinda dope.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/59.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Lyoo",
      "text": "Yes it's the Cyberpunk Underground of B-",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/60.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "Oh my god this looks so pretty-",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/61.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Lyoo",
      "text": "OH SHUT UP FOR FUCK'S SAKE",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/62.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "The fuck you want",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/63.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Lyoo",
      "text": "The Underground was specifically made to accommodate the BIT Underground Idol Competition. It's a competition where you duel fellow contestants through singing, and if you make it to the top, you'll become a world famous affiliate with CaiNiao entertainment.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/64.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "OH MY GOOOOOOOD! I WANT TO BECOME AN IDOL!",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/65.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Lyoo",
      "text": "Then sign right here to participate!",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/66.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "YEEEEEAHHH!",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/67.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Cupcakke",
      "text": "Emm, Miku… Don't you think this is a little suspicious? Don't you want to do a quick GoolooGooloo search on this entertainment company before participating? What if this guy turns out to be some evil person who will kill you? Last semester, this company worked on Connectionist AI-",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/68.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "Oh please, this twink got stick arms, he can't do shit to me.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/69.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Lyoo",
      "text": "WHAT DID YOU JUST CALL ME-",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/70.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Cupcakke",
      "text": "Fair, you got a point, I'll sign with you then.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/71.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "Yatta!",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/72.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Lyoo",
      "text": "The process of dueling an idol has one requirement, you cannot duel an idol with lower rank than you, but a lowered rank idol can duel you, and you cannot refuse.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/73.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Lyoo",
      "text": "You start at idol rank 1, successfully dueling an idol will increase your rank to the same rank as theirs.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/74.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Lyoo",
      "text": "The winner of the duel is calculated in a similar fashion as those of TokTik lives. A crowd of students will naturally emerge as you start to battle, and they will send gifts and cheers.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/75.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Lyoo",
      "text": "The idol with the most engagements and gifts will win!",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/76.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Lyoo",
      "text": "However, before you go around and duel idols, there is a trial you must complete first before actually participating though.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/77.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "What trial? Sing a song? 你是我的我的小苹果儿~",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "assets/vn/voices/ch0/78.wav",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Lyoo",
      "text": "To duel against me. Get on stage, and SING UNTIL YOUR LAST BREATH!",
